        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: മേലുദ്യോഗസ്ഥൻ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "മേലുദ്യോഗസ്ഥൻ — mēludyōgasthan — \"a superior; a senior officer\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "മേലുദ്യോഗസ്ഥൻ എന്റെ റിപ്പോർട്ട് പരിശോധിച്ചു. mēludyōgasthan enṟe ṟippōrṭṭŭ pariśōdhiccu. My superior checked my report."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "മേൽ above + ഉദ്യോഗസ്ഥൻ an official."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "മേലുദ്യോഗസ്ഥൻ (mēludyōgasthan) is a Malayalam compound built from മേൽ, \"above\", which is native (DEDR 5086), and ഉദ്യോഗസ്ഥൻ, \"an official\", from Sanskrit udyoga (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
