          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ചുമതല (cumatala) is native Dravidian: DEDR 2677 lists it beside ചുമ, \"a load\", and ചുമക്കുക, \"to carry\": a duty is a load one carries (DEDR 2677)."
